    "created_at": "2021-05-05T00:26:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-05T00:26:50Z",
    "body": "* Chromium: [Issue 630597: Unprefix -webkit-image-set](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=630597)\r\n* Webkit: [Support image-set() standard syntax ](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=160934)\r\n* [poll about image-set](https://twitter.com/bocoup/status/1130846782676541440) <img width=\"599\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2021-05-05 à 09 20 57\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/505230/117084858-39625a00-ad83-11eb-96a0-26d55c1204c0.png\">\r\n* There is no usage counter on Blink [-webkit-image-set()](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity) @foolip \r\n\r\n\r\nTo watch out probably for Webkit [\"image-src\" support is missing. We only support \"-webkit-image-src\"](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=159373)",
