    "created_at": "2021-05-06T12:32:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-06T12:32:38Z",
    "body": "Looks like the spec for this is https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images-4/#image-set-notation.\r\n\r\nShould the prefixed variant be defined to behave exactly the same, or are there differences? @schenney-chromium do you know?",
